{"unit_id":"767467025f9ac7a0a1b9","title":"追認重申及討論南區糖尿病用藥審查共識：","kind":"topic","blocks":[{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b3","raw_text":" ݟ\n","start_char":0,"end_char":3,"bbox":[42.59999084472656,124.33854675292969,326.9380798339844,141.3129119873047]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b3","raw_text":"ݠ\n","start_char":3,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.59999084472656,124.33854675292969,326.9380798339844,141.3129119873047]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b3","raw_text":"ݡ\n","start_char":5,"end_char":7,"bbox":[42.59999084472656,124.33854675292969,326.9380798339844,141.3129119873047]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b3","raw_text":"ݢ追認重申及討論南區糖尿病用藥審查共識： \n","start_char":7,"end_char":29,"bbox":[42.59999084472656,124.33854675292969,326.9380798339844,141.3129119873047]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b4","raw_text":"1. TZD、DPP4i 和SGLT2i，符合此三類藥物給付規定並檢附起始治療相關病歷與檢\n","start_char":0,"end_char":46,"bbox":[42.5859375,153.86468505859375,552.8922729492188,222.5063018798828]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b4","raw_text":"驗報告，經具體詳實記載新的臨床症狀，有轉換必要時，三者得相互轉換，例如，\n","start_char":46,"end_char":83,"bbox":[42.5859375,153.86468505859375,552.8922729492188,222.5063018798828]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b4","raw_text":"因水腫將TZD 轉成DPP4i，或有CHF、CKD、Albuminuria 將DPP4i（或TZD)轉成SGLT2i\n","start_char":83,"end_char":142,"bbox":[42.5859375,153.86468505859375,552.8922729492188,222.5063018798828]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b4","raw_text":"等。 \n","start_char":142,"end_char":146,"bbox":[42.5859375,153.86468505859375,552.8922729492188,222.5063018798828]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b5","raw_text":"2. 可開立TZD、DPP4i 和SGLT2i 之狀態如下： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[42.585941314697266,235.70391845703125,336.6256408691406,249.74391174316406]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b6","raw_text":"①已接受Metformin 劑量達1000mg/day 三個月以上，且HbA1C 仍≧7%之type2DM 患\n","start_char":0,"end_char":56,"bbox":[42.5438232421875,262.8292236328125,553.024169921875,295.107177734375]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b6","raw_text":"者。 \n","start_char":56,"end_char":60,"bbox":[42.5438232421875,262.8292236328125,553.024169921875,295.107177734375]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b7","raw_text":"② Metformin 有禁忌症（如eGFR<30)或副作用，可第一線開立。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[42.543827056884766,308.3048095703125,448.6929016113281,322.34478759765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b8","raw_text":"③ 80 歲以上type2DM 病人，未使用過Metformin 者。但若之前已使用Metformin 且\n","start_char":0,"end_char":54,"bbox":[42.55780029296875,335.54241943359375,553.0381469726562,367.7080383300781]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b8","raw_text":"病情穩定，Cr 正常，則仍可續用Metformin。 \n","start_char":54,"end_char":82,"bbox":[42.55780029296875,335.54241943359375,553.0381469726562,367.7080383300781]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b9","raw_text":"3. DPP4i/SGLT2i 複方製劑的開立：已接受最大耐受劑量Metformin，且併用SGLT2i\n","start_char":0,"end_char":53,"bbox":[42.543701171875,380.9056701660156,552.8500366210938,431.42156982421875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b9","raw_text":"或DPP4i 治療至少6 個月，無需連續2 次HbA1C 大於7.5%，於第6 個月HbA1C 大於\n","start_char":53,"end_char":104,"bbox":[42.543701171875,380.9056701660156,552.8500366210938,431.42156982421875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b9","raw_text":"7.5%者即可開立。 \n","start_char":104,"end_char":116,"bbox":[42.543701171875,380.9056701660156,552.8500366210938,431.42156982421875]}],"source_quality":["第 2 頁文字品質待核對"]}